  "question": "The scholarship management system contains multiple scholarship entries, each including a Scholarship ID, amount, application requirements, deadline, description, link, and name. The system allows user registrations, with user information comprising User ID, activation token, email, password hash, and username. Users can 'like' the scholarships they are interested in to record their preferences toward specific scholarships. Additionally, scholarships can be managed under different categories, with category information including Category ID and name; each scholarship may be associated with multiple categories. The association between users and scholarships is facilitated through a 'likes' table, which records which users have liked which scholarships.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0232\n\nCREATE TABLE `scholarship` (\n  `scholarship_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `amount` decimal(10,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `application_requirements` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `deadline` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `link` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`scholarship_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `activation_token` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `password_hash` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `username` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `category` (\n  `category_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`category_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `scholarship_category` (\n  `scholarship_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `category_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`scholarship_id`, `category_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `scholarship_category_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`scholarship_id`) REFERENCES `scholarship` (`scholarship_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `scholarship_category_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`category_id`) REFERENCES `category` (`category_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `likes` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `scholarship_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`, `scholarship_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `likes_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `likes_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`scholarship_id`) REFERENCES `scholarship` (`scholarship_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
